%% ============================================================
%% DIAGRAM 03: AI PREFERENCE WORKFLOW
%% ============================================================
%% PURPOSE:
%% Explains exactly where generative AI participates in the application.
%%
%% EXPLANATION:
%% The listener describes desired music in everyday language. Gemini proposes
%% supported genres, moods, numeric targets, and constraints. VYBE validates the
%% structure and allowed values. If Gemini is unavailable or invalid, local rules
%% provide a safe fallback. The listener can discard, approve, or correct the
%% proposal before it changes the recommendation controls.
%%
%% HOW TO READ:
%% Read the numbered messages from top to bottom. The "alt" sections show mutually
%% exclusive success, fallback, discard, and approval paths.
%%
%% KEY POINT:
%% AI output is advisory and reviewable, not an automatic recommendation decision.
%% ============================================================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Provider as Gemini Provider
    participant Schema as Pydantic Guard
    participant Demo as Deterministic Fallback
    participant Builder as Visible Vibe Builder
    participant Ranker as Deterministic Recommender

    Note over Listener,Ranker: AI output is a proposal and cannot silently modify ranking

    Listener->>UI: Describe desired music
    UI->>API: POST bounded prompt
    API->>Provider: Extract constrained preferences
    alt Provider succeeds
        Provider-->>Schema: Structured output
        Schema->>Schema: Validate enums and ranges
    else Missing key, timeout, refusal, or invalid output
        API->>Demo: Extract with local rules
        Demo-->>Schema: Deterministic structure
    end
    alt No active supported preference
        Schema-->>UI: Ambiguity and disabled Apply
    else Valid preference signal
        Schema-->>UI: Reviewable fields and provider status
        alt Listener discards
            UI-->>Listener: No recommendation state changes
        else Listener applies and corrects
            UI->>Builder: Populate visible controls
            Listener->>Builder: Adjust interpreted values
            Builder->>Ranker: Submit approved preferences
            Ranker-->>UI: Transparent recommendations
        end
    end
    Note over API,Demo: Provider and fallback status remains visible to the listener
